wifiFirmwareLoader(8)       System Manager's Manual      wifiFirmwareLoader(8)

NAME
     wifiFirmwareLoader – load wifi firmware to chip

DESCRIPTION
     wifiFirmwareLoader Load WiFi firmware, nvram, regulatory table and
     download them to WiFi chip when system boot up.

 macOS 27.0                    April 19, 2017           wifiFirmwareLoader(8)
